  "synopsis": "The world is an illusion, but love is real. At eighteen, Gao Yang accidentally discovers the cruel truth of the world: his family and friends are all terrifying \"beasts,\" and these \"beasts\" will kill anyone who discovers the truth. Facing the \"beasts'\" frenzied attacks, Gao Yang, on the verge of death, activates a mysterious system and awakens his talent Luck, thus beginning a game of survival between lamb and wolf…\n\n(Source: iQIYI, translated)",
